            <div class="promobox__content "
							>
<h2 class="h3">HSBC and Digital</h2><p>HSBC is investing in innovative technology to make banking for customers easier and more secure.</p>                <div class="in-page-link ">
<a href="/who-we-are/hsbc-and-digital" class="link-with-right-chevron" >                            <span>
